name=Tien's Customizable Hotbar
id=TienCustomizableHotbar
description=A second hotbar where any item you carry can go, even one deep in a bag. Click + or drag an item onto the bar, then click the slot or press its key: the gun comes out of your backpack and into your hands, and the next press puts it back where it came from. Each slot can also do any action from the item's own menu (drink, take pills, wear). It looks like the game's hotbar, and the game's own hotbar can be dragged anywhere too. Keys are yours to bind in the game's key bindings.
